ion":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":307135532,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMDcxMzU1MzI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:plugin","name":"topic:plugin","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310502,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA1MDI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:import","name":"topic:import","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","number":23,"title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":5,"created_at":"2025-03-23T15:53:05Z","updated_at":"2025-10-01T18:21:15Z","closed_at":"2025-10-01T18:20:17Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n\n- Reproducible in 4.4.stable, 4.2.2.stable\n- Reproducible in build of current master (2303ce843a362cf5497ca3336451de23793eb711)\n- Reproducible in 4.0.stable (can be imported, but not opened)\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.stable - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3070 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.7270) - AMD Ryzen 7 3700X 8-Core Processor (16 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nIt seems that the default implementations of `_get_priority` and `_get_import_order` are not used correctly. Both the tutorial and documentation for `EditorImportPlugin` suggests that these have a default value.\n\nHowever, not adding them causes these error messages:\n```\n  ERROR: Unimplemented _get_priority in add-on.\n  ERROR: Unimplemented _get_priority in add-on.\n  ERROR: BUG: File queued for import, but can't be imported, importer for type '' not found.\n```\nImplementing only\n```\nfunc _get_priority() -> float:\n\treturn 1.0\n```\nthe resource can be imported but not opened in the inspector:\n```\nERROR: editor/editor_node.cpp:1358 - Condition \"res.is_null()\" is true. Returning: ERR_CANT_OPEN\n```\nI also need to add`_get_import_order`:\n```\nfunc _get_import_order() -> int:\n\treturn 0\n```\nThen I need to deactivate/activate the plugin, delete the existing resource file and create a new one, re-importing does not fix it.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nBasically, I followed the [tutorial for an import plugin](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/plugins/editor/import_plugins.html):\n- Create new plugin\n- Add EditorImportPlugin following the documentation\n- Register the import plugin\n- Activate the plugin\n- Create a test resource `a.mtxt`\n- The resource import fails\n\nThe minimal files for the plugin are attached.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[repro-import-plugin.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19409903/repro-import-plugin.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104519/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104519/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}